<h3><u>Baba Baba Hussain</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain..(4)</p>

<p>Sham-e-ghareebaa al amaa, phaila hua har su dhua</p>

<p>Nauha kuna saidaniya, ghash me pada hai ek natawa</p>

<p>Pyasi sakina nauhakhwaa</p>

<p>Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Sakina ki ati thi sada.. Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Jalte hue khaime idhar, lashe tadapte the udhar</p>

<p>Karbobala ki khaak par, boli sakina rakhke sar</p>

<p>Baba suno meri fugha</p>

<p>Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Sakina ki ati thi sada.. Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Bade nabi taraaj hai, sholo ka har su raaj hai</p>

<p>Haye kafan ke waste, baba mera mohtaj hai</p>

<p>Kitna bada hai imtehaa</p>

<p>Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Sakina ki ati thi sada.. Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Shame masaeb aagai, andhi ghamo ki cha gai</p>

<p>Mai janibe darya gai, lashe chacha tharra gai</p>

<p>Kano se khoo dekha rawa</p>

<p>Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Sakina ki ati thi sada.. Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Rukhsar nile hogae, itne tamache hail age</p>

<p>Baba khuda ke waste, mujhko lagalo seene se</p>

<p>Dukhti hai meri pasliyaa</p>

<p>Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Sakina ki ati thi sada.. Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Tapti zami jalti hawa, ae maqtal-e-karbobala</p>

<p>Ek dopaher me kya hua, loota gaya kunba mera</p>

<p>Chadar na sar pe saaebaa</p>

<p>Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Sakina ki ati thi sada.. Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Ek reesma bara gale, kuch is tarah bandhe gaye</p>

<p>Har aati jaati saans bhi, jaise koi khanjar chale</p>

<p>Nazuk gale me reesma</p>

<p>Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Sakina ki ati thi sada.. Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Rassi me baba bandh gae, taza sitam hone ko hai</p>

<p>Zanjeer lae ashqiyaa, beemar aabid ke liye</p>

<p>Pehna rahe hai bediyaa</p>

<p>Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Sakina ki ati thi sada.. Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Kya sarwar-o-rehan ham, batlae rudade sitam</p>

<p>Nazuk se dil ke ranjo ghum, kehti rahi wo dam ba dam</p>

<p>Ab tum kaha aur hum kaha</p>

<p>Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Sakina ki ati thi sada.. Baba baba Husain..(3)</p>

<p>Hussain, hussain,hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</p>